<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Residential started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Residential started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney started its coverage of American Residential Services Inc with a buy rating, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 18-1/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
